## 5. Quick Start for Developer
To test the engine:
1. Run `mini-services/whisper-service` (for transcription).
2. Run the `hyper-engine` pipeline via `python render_pipeline.py <video_path> <style_id>`.
3. Verify the output at `output_final.mp4`.
